{"id":"2J","title":"Serving and Worshiping God","part":{"n":2,"title":"Relationship to God"},"url":"/law/02-relationship-to-god/2j","entries":[{"id":"2J.1","text":"We are commanded to serve God and to hold fast to Him.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":6,"verses":"13"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":10,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":13,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":1,"verses":"74"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":1,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Deut. 6:13; Deut. 10:20; Deut 13:4; Luke 1:74; Rom. 1:9."},{"id":"2J.2","text":"You are to serve the LORD your God with all your heart and with all your soul.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":10,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":11,"verses":"13"},{"book":"Joshua","chapter":22,"verses":"5"},{"book":"1 Samuel","chapter":12,"verses":"24"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":119,"verses":"69"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":6,"verses":"5-6"}],"citation":"Deut. 10:12; Deut 11:13; Josh. 22:5; 1 Sam. 12:24; Psa. 119:69; Eph. 6:5-6."},{"id":"2J.3","text":"We are exhorted to worship and serve only God.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":34,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":5,"verses":"7-9"},{"book":"1 Samuel","chapter":12,"verses":"14"},{"book":"2 Kings","chapter":17,"verses":"36"},{"book":"1 Chronicles","chapter":16,"verses":"29"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":95,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":96,"verses":"9"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":99,"verses":"5"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":4,"verses":"10"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":4,"verses":"8"},{"book":"John","chapter":4,"verses":"23-24"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":14,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":19,"verses":"10"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":22,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Exod. 34:14; Deut. 5:7-9; 1 Sam. 12:14; 2 Kings 17:36; 1 Chron. 16:29; Psa. 95:6; Psa. 96:9; Psa. 99:5; Matt. 4:10; Luke 4:8; John 4:23-24; Rev. 14:7; Rev. 19:10; Rev. 22:9."},{"id":"2J.4","text":"No true Christian lives or dies for himself, but lives or dies for Christ.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":14,"verses":"7-8"}],"citation":"Rom. 14:7- 8."},{"id":"2J.5","text":"A faithful servant of Christ is to occupy his Kingdom.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":19,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"Luke 19:13."},{"id":"2J.6","text":"As servants of Christ you are His freemen and thus are not to be servants of men.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":7,"verses":"22-23"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 7:22-23."},{"id":"2J.7","text":"True worship and service to God requires not formalism or excessive piety but to do justly, to love mercy, and to walk humbly with God.","refs":[{"book":"Hosea","chapter":6,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Micah","chapter":6,"verses":"6-8"}],"citation":"Hos. 6:6; Mic. 6:6-8."},{"id":"2J.8","text":"You shall not worship the LORD your God in the manner that the heathen nations serve their gods.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":12,"verses":"30-31"}],"citation":"Deut 12:30-31."},{"id":"2J.9","text":"A good and faithful servant of God is one that is fruitful and productive with the abilities and resources God has given him.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":25,"verses":"14-30"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":19,"verses":"12-25"}],"citation":"Matt. 25:14-30; Luke 19:12-25."},{"id":"2J.10","text":"No man can serve two masters; You cannot serve God and wealth.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":6,"verses":"24"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":16,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"Matt. 6:24; Luke 16:13."},{"id":"2J.11","text":"True worshipers are to worship the Father in spirit and in truth.","refs":[{"book":"John","chapter":4,"verses":"23-24"}],"citation":"John 4:23-24."},{"id":"2J.12","text":"By serving Christ you will receive from Him the reward of the inheritance.","refs":[{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"24"}],"citation":"Col. 3:24."},{"id":"2J.13","text":"Blessed are those servants whom Christ shall find on the alert and doing according to his will.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":12,"verses":"35-48"}],"citation":"Luke 12:35-48."},{"id":"2J.14","text":"You shall worship the LORD your God, and Him only you shall serve.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":4,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Luke 4:8."},{"id":"2J.15","text":"No man, having put his hand to the plow (to follow and serve God), and then looking back, is fit for the kingdom of God.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":9,"verses":"61-62"}],"citation":"Luke 9:61-62."},{"id":"2J.16","text":"Serve God with a perfect heart.","refs":[{"book":"1 Chronicles","chapter":28,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"1 Chron. 28:9."},{"id":"2J.17","text":"Serve God in sincerity and truth.","refs":[{"book":"Joshua","chapter":24,"verses":"14"}],"citation":"Josh. 24:14."},{"id":"2J.18","text":"Serve the LORD with gladness.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":100,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"Psa. 100:1."},{"id":"2J.19","text":"Serve the LORD with fear.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":2,"verses":"11"}],"citation":"Psa. 2:11."},{"id":"2J.20","text":"We are not to worship angels.","refs":[{"book":"Judges","chapter":13,"verses":"15"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":2,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":22,"verses":"8-9"}],"citation":"Judges 13:15; Col. 2:18; Rev. 22:8-9."}]}